        "location": "engine/runtime/memorycard-opencode-plugin.mjs:204-212",
        "claim": "The 128-session bound evicts in insertion order, and child sessions (which are also recorded, with empty text) count toward it. A main session that outlives 128 other sessions, which subagent-heavy work can produce, is forgotten. Its next model call asks memorycard again. That can change the system prompt mid-session, or insert the block mid-session after a failed first ask. This is the cache instability the commit set out to remove. An eviction while an ask is in flight also writes the result to an orphaned entry.",
